{"seq":16,"slug":"api-rate-limiting","title":"API 限流与流量治理","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# API 限流与流量治理\n\n在分布式系统中，任何对外暴露的 API 端点都面临着流量不可预测的现实。一次营销活动、一个失控的爬虫脚本、甚至一个客户端的重试风暴，都可能在短时间内将数据库连接池耗尽，导致雪崩式的级联故障。限流（Rate Limiting）正是应对这种威胁的第一道防线——它在请求到达核心业务逻辑之前就做出\"放行/拒绝\"的决策，将系统负载维持在可控范围内。\n\n本 hub 聚焦于 API 限流的算法原理、分布式实现、架构模式与生产运维四个维度。与兄弟 hub 的分工边界如下：\n\n- **微服务架构 hub**（`04_microservices-architecture`）侧重服务拆分、通信模式与 API 网关的整体设计，限流只是其中一个横切关注点；本 hub 则深入限流本身的算法、存储与决策引擎。\n- **服务网格 hub**（`14_service-mesh`）讨论 Envoy/Istio 等 sidecar 代理的流量管理全貌（路由、重试、熔断）；本 hub 专注于其中的限流 filter 配置与全局/本地限流协同。\n- **事件驱动架构 hub**（`15_event-driven-architecture`）关注异步消息流的背压（backpressure）与消费速率控制；本 hub 则面向同步 API 请求的速率限制。\n\n推荐学习路径因读者背景而异：\n\n1. **后端工程师（初学限流）**：从第一章\"基础\"开始，理解四种经典算法及选型逻辑，再进入第二章了解 Redis 分布式计数，最后看第三、四章的架构与运维。\n2. **平台/SRE 工程师**：可直接从第三章\"模式\"切入网关层限流与自适应并发，再回溯第二章补齐 Redis 实现细节，最后关注第四章的可观测性与降级策略。\n3. **架构师/技术负责人**：建议先通读第三章的多租户配额设计，再看第四章生产最佳实践，按需回查算法与分布式章节。\n\n前置知识：理解 HTTP 请求-响应模型、基本的并发概念（竞态条件、原子操作）、Redis 基础数据结构。若对微服务网关不熟悉，建议先阅读微服务架构 hub 的 API 网关章节。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"限流基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rate-limiting-fundamentals","title":"限流基本概念与动机","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/foundations/rate-limiting-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"classic-algorithms","title":"经典限流算法","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/foundations/classic-algorithms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"algorithm-selection","title":"算法选型与权衡","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/foundations/algorithm-selection"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed","title":"分布式限流","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/distributed","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"distributed-counting","title":"分布式计数与一致性","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/distributed/distributed-counting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"redis-rate-limiting","title":"Redis 限流实现","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/distributed/redis-rate-limiting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-cluster-sync","title":"多集群同步与跨数据中心限流","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/distributed/multi-cluster-sync"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"patterns","title":"限流架构模式","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gateway-rate-limiting","title":"网关层限流","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/patterns/gateway-rate-limiting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"adaptive-concurrency","title":"自适应并发控制","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/patterns/adaptive-concurrency"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-tenant-quotas","title":"多租户配额与分级策略","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/patterns/multi-tenant-quotas"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"限流运维与生产实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graceful-degradation","title":"优雅降级与故障处理","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/operations/graceful-degradation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"observability-analytics","title":"可观测性与限流分析","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/operations/observability-analytics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"production-best-practices","title":"生产环境最佳实践","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/operations/production-best-practices"}]}]}